    "text": "package Static_Expressions is\n\n   C1 : constant := 300_453.5;\n   C2 : constant := 455_233.5 * C1;\n   C3 : constant := 872_922.5 * C2;\n   C4 : constant := 155_277.5 * C1 + C2 / C3;\n   C5 : constant := 2.0 * C1 +\n                    3.0 * (C2 / (C4 * C3)) +\n                    4.0 * (C1 / (C2 * C2)) +\n                    5.0 * (C3 / (C1 * C1));\n\nend Static_Expressions;\n",
